{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12423","headline":"九日宴浙江西亭 · 钱起","name":"九日宴浙江西亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗人九日怜芳菊，筵客高斋宴浙江。\n渔浦浪花摇素壁，西陵树色入秋窗。\n木奴向熟悬金实，桑落新开泻玉缸。\n四子醉时争讲习，笑论黄霸旧爲邦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12423.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12423","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}